  if (t.length > s.length) return 0;

  const limit = 2147483647;
  const dp = new Array(t.length + 1).fill(0);
  dp[0] = 1;

  for (let i = 0; i < s.length; i++) {
    for (let j = Math.min(t.length, i + 1); j >= 1; j--) {
      if (s[i] === t[j - 1]) {
        dp[j] = Math.min(limit, dp[j] + dp[j - 1]);
      }
    }
  }

  return dp[t.length];
}
```

Call solve(s, t) directly; no stdin/stdout, imports, or exports. With n = s.length and m = t.length, time is O(nm + n + m + 1), including empty inputs; auxiliary space is O(m + 1).

